# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files for more about ignoring files.
#
# LOCKSTEP ACROSS ALL EIGHT DEMOS — bin/check-demo-copies declares this path
# :identical and fails the build when a copy drifts. Nothing in a .gitignore is
# per-port or per-host, and a demo that quietly loses a line here is how a
# `credentials.yml.enc` reaches CI without its key.
# The repo-root .gitignore covers the machine-local files (mise.toml, .bundle,
# .env, editor cruft) for every subtree, so they do not belong here.

# Ignore bundler config.
/.bundle

# Ignore the default SQLite database.
/db/*.sqlite3
/db/*.sqlite3-*

# Ignore all logfiles and tempfiles.
/log/*
/tmp/*
!/log/.keep
!/tmp/.keep

# Ignore pidfiles, but keep the directory.
/tmp/pids/*
!/tmp/pids/
!/tmp/pids/.keep

# Ignore storage (uploaded files in development and any SQLite databases).
/storage/*
!/storage/.keep

# Ignore the master key and any other credentials key, and the encrypted
# credentials file itself: an enc committed without its (ignored) key is an AEAD
# boot failure — CI goes red with no code change behind it.
/config/master.key
/config/*.key
/config/credentials.yml.enc

# Ignore Spring files.
/spring/*.pid
